@startuml
title State Machine - Entity Task and Plan Step Status

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Queued : task assigned by plan/dialog
Queued --> Running : TaskStack primitive created
Running --> Running : tick evaluates DesiredState

Running --> Completed : task completion condition met
Running --> Failed : timeout / invalid route / severe inconsistent data
Running --> TargetUnavailable : target missing or destroyed
Running --> Cancelled : user clears task / plan stops

Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
TargetUnavailable --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

state Running {
  [*] --> Evaluating
  Evaluating --> FollowEntityMode : taskType == FollowEntity
  Evaluating --> InterceptEntityMode : taskType == InterceptEntity
  Evaluating --> FollowRouteMode : taskType == FollowRoute
  Evaluating --> MoveMode : MoveToLocation/Waypoint/RTB

  FollowEntityMode --> Evaluating : maintain distance
  InterceptEntityMode --> Evaluating : close horizontal + vertical tolerance
  FollowRouteMode --> Evaluating : advance waypoint index
  MoveMode --> Evaluating : navigate to fixed target
}

note right of Completed
PlanStep Completed triggers next step.
For Intercept Entity:
horizontalDistance <= interceptDistanceMeters
and verticalDifference <= altitudeToleranceMeters.
end note

note right of Failed
Follow Route does not fail because of overshoot.
Expected route failures:
- timeout
- invalid/empty route
- destroyed/cancelled
- severe inconsistent data
end note

@enduml
